      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLarge Semi-Detached Property In Need of Major Investment.\n\nWorks and renovations had started on this property a while ago but were not completed.\n\nAccess cannot be granted within building for viewings due to structural reasons. \n\nA load bearing internal wall has been removed and the upper floor has been inadequately supported by timber beams and Acro props.\n\nProperty sold as seen.\n\nThe property is built c. 45 years, containing c. 131 sq.m. (c. 1,550 sq.ft.) of accommodation \n\nLakelands is a mature residential development of semi-detached houses situated in an excellent central location close to Town Centre, Naas Hospital and Vista Primary Care Facility. \n\nNaas offers a wealth of amenities on your doorstep whether a relaxing evening out with fine pubs and restaurants or superb shopping, leisure facilities and schools.\n\nThe town is an ideal commuter destination only 23 km south west of the M50 with the N7 three lane carriageway, bus route and commuter train service from Sallins direct to City Centre.\n\nJoint Agent: Darac O'Neill BSc (Hons) Dip Arb Law MRICS, MSCSI, MCIArb\n\nRegister on https://www.mysherryfitz.ie/buyers/sign_in#register to place offers"
      },
      {
